{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_06",
  "title": "告解",
  "storyCode": "MT-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "46fb531f6f2a983432783f355c9019d63f47901db38ae568bc33471e0ec1ad09",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "看來我們白跑一趟了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "房間內很多地方都沒有人活動的痕跡，搖椅、咖啡壺和銃靶這些他常用的器具已滿是灰塵……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "終端上沒有通訊記錄或異常留言，暫時未能找到更多證據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "初步判斷，教宗伊萬杰利斯塔十一世，已經失蹤半個月左右。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "……雖然已經有了心理準備，雖然和教宗閣下只有一面之緣，但真正得知他出事了，還是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "阿爾圖羅，給出解釋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "你似乎瞭解教宗閣下的行蹤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "又見面了，“拉特蘭的糖果爺爺”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "不過，教皇廳的聯合審理已經結束，您也簽署了針對我的判決書。一位囚徒，不應該再有私下會見教宗閣下的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "考慮得怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "這麼直接？我還以為您會說一些“飯後走走就到了這裡”之類的玩笑話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "關於我是否願意成為所謂的“聖徒”，在羅德島的時候，我們已經有過深入的交流——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "當然當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "我還蠻喜歡那艘船的，可惜相會的時間太短。我還記得那晚的霞光，和你演奏的那個很不“拉特蘭”的調子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "以及，你說的，希望我提供更多的證據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "孩子，還記得我說過的話嗎？“我們所知的任何光亮都有寂滅如黯的那一天。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "哈哈，印象很深。畢竟那是一句很有趣的表達。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "而這一天，快要來了……當然，只是我的預感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "教宗指了指自己頭頂的光環。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "這段時間，它頻頻給予我警示，卻不再回應我的任何發問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "這是，什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "換句話說，我們光輝的律法突然變得不可被解讀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "我只會拉琴，閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "當然當然，解經是教宗的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "現在工作遇到了麻煩，我會去想辦法解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "那您需要我做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "保持警惕……我不清楚具體會發生什麼，所以我只能這樣提醒你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "如果整座聖城的燈都熄滅，相信你所想的“理解”，你所想的“情感”，你所想的無所保留的、純粹而坦誠的“交流”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "你這樣的異類，到那時或許是一劑良藥，或許是一劑毒藥……但總歸會讓事情有些轉機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "聽起來，我沒有什麼拒絕的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "不過，拉特蘭的異類，不只有我一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "當然，接下來我會去聯絡其他聖徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_356_1",
      "text": "……但願時間還來得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "所以，你才會那麼早對周遭發生的事情產生懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "也不全是如此，費迪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "一個人的心聲哪怕沒有變奏，但那些增補和缺失的章節融入得太過自然，我很難感受不到。席德佳修女就是個很好的例子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "我更在意的是，教宗閣下還來不及找你，意外便已經發生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "局勢太過複雜，整個拉特蘭都陷入了難以理解的災異中，程度與我們在巫王的帕維永中所經歷的相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "我們需要支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "幸好，我帶了我的琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "老師？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒有人回答。\n梵里妮在銃械工坊轉了一圈，沒有發現老師的身影，他的眼藥水還放在操作台上，甚至連蓋子都還沒蓋回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔鄰居",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "梵妮，你終於回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "啊、啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔鄰居",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "之前來了一個銃騎，把潘格尼尼帶走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔鄰居",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "銃騎臨走的時候交代，如果發現你回來了，讓你快點去教皇廳配合調查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔鄰居",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "梵妮，你們是惹上什麼事了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔鄰居",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "總之你快點去教皇廳吧。那個銃騎的態度，不是很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "老師……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "肯定是因為自己和小樂姐的事情，不管怎樣，不能讓老師受到牽連，她想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "等等，這些是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一些彈殼，三兩成堆地散落在操作台的角落，看起來像是不拘小節的製銃師隨手落下的。\n梵里妮戴上手套開始收拾彈殼，一如往常。可恍然間，她竟覺得自己認識這些彈殼，像認識一位故人。\n彈殼表面光滑平整，連雕紋也被磨平，不知被人撫摩過多少次——什麼彈殼會被人反覆撫摩，又是什麼人會如此珍視平平無奇的彈殼？\n梵里妮摘下手套。她感受到彈殼上還殘留著些許溫熱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "潘……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "*拉特蘭俚語*——主！你把我的眼鏡都嚇掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "你現在終於要開始說話了嗎！都四歲了啊，哪有薩科塔到你這個年紀還不會說話、不長光環的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "好吧，我在做夢。你還是不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "要不是偶然撿到你，我早就離開這個破地方了。一想到還和帕特里奇昂那傢伙生活在同一個城市，我就渾身難受……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "結果呢，醫院和教堂去得也不少，還是沒人知道你到底是從娘胎裡帶了什麼毛病，還是你們的“主”對你有意見……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "過去三年了，你沒光環，我也沒光環，我也不知道你在想什麼，對著一個“小啞巴”我都習慣了，我自己的話都變少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "算了，既然你沒半夜逃跑，我就當作是你還樂意待在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "話我也不跟你多說了，說了你也沒反應，跟木頭一樣。你要是什麼時候突然想交流了，自己想個辦法告訴我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "梵妮，鬆開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "怎麼突然之間像被按到了什麼開關一樣，抱著我又哭又笑的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "平常跟你說什麼你都沒反應，你不會打算現在把這幾年的反應全補回來吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "還有，你腦袋上突然多出來的那頂燈泡是怎麼回事？那些醫生啊修士啊治了三年都沒點效果……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "你跟那個叫蕾繆樂的孩子一起選了把銃就好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "潘……唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "嘖，還是不會說話。你們薩科塔不是開口說話的時候長光環嗎？怎麼，是光環耐不住寂寞，破例提前長出來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "（抓住老師的手用力點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "我也不是薩科塔，理解不了你和那孩子透過守護銃完成了怎樣的交流，這件事對你來說又有多大的意義……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "總之，我知道你不是個沒心沒肺的傢伙就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "（握緊老師臉上的羽毛）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "好了好了好了，痛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "你要是願意理我，我倒是有個不那麼激烈的交流方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "坐在桌子旁邊，坐好！看見這些彈殼了嗎？我教你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "我、我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "我為什麼……會說話？我不該……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "對小梵里妮來說，“理解”與“表達”是一對鏽壞的門窗，阻隔了她與他人的一切連繫。\n她與那個囉哩囉嗦陰陽怪氣的黎博利一起生活了三年，既搞不清對方何時開心又何時生氣，也不會表達自己如何煩惱又如何熱愛。\n她不曾想到自己的人生中會闖入一個頭髮如火般紅，人也如火般熱情的薩科塔，用無需語言的方式，在她封閉的心房炸開一個洞口。\n在那之後，老師一個詞一個詞地，用小小的彈殼為她拼成了一套完整的語言。哪怕她後來學會了一些簡單詞句，他們也依舊會用彈殼交流。\n可如今，她早已不記得自己是何時掌握了最複雜的語句，更不知自己已經多少次若無其事地將老師擺在桌上的彈殼收進垃圾桶。\n她不敢想像老師是怎樣迷茫地撫摩著他們用了十幾年的彈殼，不明白記憶深處的這門特殊的語言為何不再被理解。\n透過朦朧的淚眼，她久違地重新理解了那些彈殼傳遞的訊息——而那訊息是個警告！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "不……老師——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔鄰居",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "對了梵妮，我想起來一件事，有點在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔鄰居",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "那個銃騎帶潘格尼尼走的時候，好像不是去教皇廳的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔鄰居",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "text": "反而像是……去育嬰聖堂的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "蕾繆安樞機，抱歉來遲了，剛剛在整理銃械工坊的接收文件，太多了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "怎麼是您？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "阿摩斯輔佐官，請坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "別緊張，只是傳達一下教皇廳的最新指令而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "什麼樣的指令，需要您親自來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "教皇廳決定暫停蕾繆安樞機的所有工作，在她的職務審查結束之前，由你代理第七廳樞機一職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "什、什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "你沒聽錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "第七廳的辦公大樓不久前遭遇了不明勢力的襲擊，先前試圖破壞萬國峰會的嫌犯蕾繆樂趁亂逃走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "而蕾繆安樞機，在明明已經追上嫌犯的前提下，擅自放走嫌犯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "經過進一步調查，此前在司提望區爆炸案和育嬰聖堂受襲案中，她同樣具有類似行為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "蕾繆安樞機嚴重違反了第七廳的行事準則，觸犯了律法之禁忌……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "可是，為什麼是我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "如果沒有你提供的關鍵線索，此前我們便無法抓獲嫌犯，或許降生儀式也會遭到破壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "阿摩斯，你已經在第七廳待了十幾年了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "再過兩個月，剛好十四年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "你已經是第七廳資歷最深的員工了，你熟悉這裡的一切事務，沒有比你更適合的人選了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "或許你沒能在更重要的位置上發揮作用的原因，從來都不是能力不足，而僅僅是缺乏一個契機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "小子，有自信一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "“小子”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "帕特里奇昂閣下，我一直以為，您沒有多喜歡我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "我到現在都還記得，第一次和奧羅拉去拜訪您的時候，您甚至沒有露面，還是剛放學的菲亞梅塔接待我們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "確實談不上喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "奧羅拉曾是我最看重的學生，在重裝作戰和銃械使用上擁有絕佳的天賦。但她的性格太強勢，行事風格過於極端……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "而你太過軟弱……不過，那都是你們自己的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "再說一遍，那天我不在家是因為甲胄壞了臨時要去修！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "而且，真要論起私情，恐怕你對我的意見更大吧？畢竟，當年是我親手把奧羅拉驅逐出了拉特蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "那件事……我只是恨我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "您說得對，我是個太過軟弱、沒什麼作為的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "我和奧羅拉在一起，卻沒能幫助她化解身上的戾氣，在那座修道院裡，她傷害那些被收監的薩卡茲，最後又將銃口指向自己的同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "而在她鑄成彌天大錯後，我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "帕特里奇昂閣下，我甚至沒能見到她的最後一面……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "我、我什麼都做不到……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "那就想想你現在還能做到什麼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "現在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "萬國峰會還沒有結束，第七廳接下來還有很多事務需要處理，由你暫任樞機，這是教皇廳的決議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "移交審核已經完成，你現在可以使用樞機的所有權限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "等等，這、這麼快？我、我還沒有……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "阿摩斯樞機，災異當前，拉特蘭需要講求效率。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "text": "所以，我們就不為你準備歡迎茶點了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "銃騎已經離開，阿摩斯隨便拉開一張椅子坐了下來。他打開自己的操作終端，帕特里奇昂說得沒錯，他的權限日誌已經更新。\n這一切發生得太快，他需要一點時間適應……他突然想到了什麼。\n他點進資料夾，一路向下滑動，在最底部找到了目標。\n他點開那份檔案，手指停留在簽名確認欄的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "奧羅拉，終於……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "新晉第七廳樞機阿摩斯，在終端面板上看見自己的臉上露出了笑容。\n有點可笑，他想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "嗯——這、這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "是拉特蘭，我們終於回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "不，這裡看起來也不正常……那些、那些異色的影子……你看它們的形狀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "它們投影的是……那座育嬰聖堂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "怎麼會，到底是拉特蘭變了，還是我們永久性腦損傷了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "小心！你的背後！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒙恩的生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1792_1",
      "text": "（禱告聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "被賦予光環的生物？這裡也有？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "越來越多了！等等，別過來，我本來就有光環了，不用再裝一個……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "射得好！這個東西不會躲子彈——這樣就沒什麼好怕的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "愣著幹嘛？我們清一條路出去……你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "我、我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1795_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "你、你墮天了……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "或許是你我的甦醒產生了影響，已經陸續有人醒來。但這些頂著光環的生物也變得越來越多了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "那些生物把醒來的人拖進了異色的投影當中，然後一起消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "他們甚至無法反擊。對那些生物射擊的薩科塔……墮天了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "費迪，看來之前的玩笑成真了。這些傢伙……也算是薩科塔，我們的，同胞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "牠們的心聲何其陌生，何其混沌……我該從中聽取什麼？我又該與牠們分享什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "啊……牠們也同樣為無法觸及我們的心緒而焦躁。牠們迫切地想要分享，卻只能笨拙地用蠻力實現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "像是還未長出光環的嬰孩，不論想表達什麼，都只能哭鬧著撕扯父母的衣袖……牠們確實是我們的同胞，只是還太稚拙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "太稚拙，卻太有力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "律法在嬰孩開口能言的那一刻為其賦予光環，是因為言語代表著理性的啟蒙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "而理性，代表著一個薩科塔終於有了對同胞、對律法負責的能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "律法何以會將一群未經啟蒙的生物判定為“薩科塔”，又驅使牠們用蠻力干預同胞的命運？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "異常之處只增不減。目前我們還能尋求合作的對象只有博士。博士既然已經來到了拉特蘭，必然是對眼下的情況有所瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "阿爾圖羅，你確定博士記得你的琴聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "我在羅德島有過為數不多的幾次演奏，博士幾乎都在場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "頗為可惜的是，博士並非我演奏的對象，但也值得慶幸，博士似乎每次都聽得很認真呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "text": "只有第一句是有效資訊，阿爾圖羅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "哈哈好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "那麼費迪，我會用琴聲為博士引路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突兀的通訊提示音打斷了兩人的談話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "text": "這個時間，打到這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "費德里科接通了通訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂……能……聽到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "奧羅拉……前公民編號……LC0073458。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一批離群的薩科塔與戰爭難民……現位於，拉特蘭城北部……三公里位置……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "申請進入拉特蘭城。"
    },
